              "value": "{{Galileo-API-Key}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Reorder templates within an annotation queue.\n\nThe ordering must include all and only the template IDs currently in the queue.\nTemplates will be assigned positions 1, 2, 3... based on their order in the list."
        },
